              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Customer analysis shows that the Consumer segment contributes the strongest overall sales and profit performance, followed by Corporate and Home Office. Product-level analysis further highlights substantial differences in sales and profitability across departments, categories and individual products. The Top-N view identifies the strongest revenue-generating products, helping management prioritise valuable customer segments and high-performing product lines.' captured-sheet='Customer &amp; Product Performance' id='1' />
