              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='The retailer generated approximately $33.05 million in net sales and $3.97 million in profit from 65,752 orders, producing an overall profit margin of about 12%. Monthly sales were relatively stable for most of the period before declining sharply toward the end, while category performance shows that a small number of product categories contribute a substantial share of sales and profit.' captured-sheet='Executive Overview' id='1' />
